# Team roles

Read `AGENTS.md` and `TEAM.md` before any code change.

- One role per chat: Consultant, HR, Manager, or Orchestrator. Ask if unspecified.
- Edit only that role’s files (see `TEAM.md`). Refuse other members’ work.
- Do not rebuild `app/rag/`. Consultant calls `answer_with_rag`.
- Keep stub `run()` input/output keys. Do not change DB schema or commit `.env`.
- Smallest implementation that meets **Done when**, then stop.
